WEBVTT

NOTE Machine draft — owner proofreading required before production.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
We're on our Shorn project today.

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.880
We've been here for two days.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.320
It's a complete rip out and reinstall of this house.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.560
We've planted well over 70 different plants here.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.900
Anything ranging from cusa dogwoods

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.880
for more upright coverage to boxwoods to accent planting,

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.280
such as Japanese forest grasses, hydrangeas,

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.000
things of that nature.
